Execution Payload
Inputs
The pipeline takes a raw JSON review string, combines it with the dynamically generated JSON schema (StructuredReview), and sends the formatted prompt to the model:

JSON
{
  "input": "\nGiven the following review:\n```\n{\n    \"review_id\": \"R12345\",\n    \"rating\": \"★★★★☆ (4 stars)\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-01-01\",\n    \"text\": \"This is a great product!\"\n}\n```\n\nConvert it into a structured JSON object that conforms to the following schema:\n{...schema definitions...}\n\nOutput the JSON object only, no other text or delimiters.\n"
}
Outputs
The LLM successfully processes the input and returns a strictly typed JSON structure matching the defined Pydantic schema:

