Schema Architecture
The traced execution strictly validates against the following components:

StructuredReview:

review_id (string): Unique identifier matching the review.

overall_sentiment (string): General tone (positive, negative, neutral, or mixed).

notable_phrases (array of strings): Key quotes extracted directly from the text.

opinions (array of Opinion objects): Granular category breakdowns.

Opinion:

topic (string): Categorized under one of: App Functionality, UI & UX, Payment & Checkout, Product Information, Order Operations, or Customer Service.

sentiment (string): Sentiment specifically associated with the topic.

problem (string | null): Identified issues or complaints.

suggested_solution (string | null): Proposed remedies.
